    #[SchemaTypeInfo(rdfs_comment: 'A ProductGroup represents a group of <a href="https://schema.org/Product" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Product</a>s that vary only in certain well-described ways, such as by <a href="https://schema.org/size" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">size</a>, <a href="https://schema.org/color" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">color</a>, <a href="https://schema.org/material" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">material</a> etc.

